   531	
   532	def collect(base: Path, jobs_by_dir: dict, gate: dict | None, smoke: bool = False) -> dict:
   533	    """Records for both winner sets (recs[rate][market][rule] with gains, attack and reference terms, efficiency and
   534	    seeds), R3's audit counts for both sets, and the winner counts. Every record is checked before use (review
   535	    rep-impl-r2): a cell whose evaluation or doubling record fails base_problem is unscorable (plan section 4); a frozen
   536	    diagnostics row that fails diag_ok gives no audit count. Only flagged cells look at a continuation record; a flagged
   537	    cell without one is "not continued". The primary set is unavailable after a round-1 mismatch in any continuation
   538	    record or without this run's identical gate record (also when no cell is flagged). A flagged cell whose continuation
